<title>UK: Spintab sets $300 million FRN due 1999.</title>
<headline>Spintab sets $300 million FRN due 1999.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPINTAB</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    12.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  100.0115  FULL FEES   0.05</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/SW</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
